# Example pipeline run outputs: only rtfm_mini is pushed to GitHub, as a
# complete end-to-end example. Every other example run (bpic2019,
# bpic2020_permit, rtfm, sepsis) stays local-only — reproduce them via
# experimentation/examples/ instead. See experimentation/README.md for the
# time/cost/memory/disk footprint of each before running one.
data/output/*
!data/output/rtfm_mini/

# Pairwise distance matrices: CSV is redundant with parquet. Applies within
# rtfm_mini too (the only example whose output is tracked above).
data/output/*/*/round1/06_assignment/profile_distances.csv
data/output/*/*/round1/06_assignment/structural_distances.csv
data/output/*/*/round2/06_assignment/profile_distances.csv
data/output/*/*/round2/06_assignment/structural_distances.csv